{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me analyze this puzzle step by step:\n\n1. A book (Book A) was a contender for an award\n2. The award itself was originally created in the 2000s\n3. Book A was translated into over 25 languages\n4. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won that same award\n5. Book B had been released the preceding year\n6. The author of Book B was born in the same city where the author of Book A grew up\n7. Question: In what city was the author of Book A born?\n\nLet me search for awards created in the 2000s that are literary prizes.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created founded 2000s prize\", \"book award established 2000s translated twenty five languages\", \"international book award founded 2000s\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_dcb2074a597b4ee489b9e884","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789467360,"id":"chatcmpl-702cc852-5d19-9b6a-872c-35ad6164a5eb","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":194,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4064,"cached_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}